{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（2日）早上10時許，警方在九龍城東頭村道美東邨對開截獲一輛的士，經調查揭發年約70歲的男司機涉嫌毒後駕駛，將他拘捕調查。警方隨後召來緝毒犬，以黑布蒙頭押解涉事司機在場搜證。</p><p>現場消息稱，的士行駛期間左搖右擺，交通警察覺可疑將它截停，其間發現司機目光呆滯，未能正常對答，經初步毒理測試，驗出對海洛英及可卡因毒品呈陽性反應，懷疑有人涉毒後駕駛。</p><figure><img alt=\"警方押解疑犯在場搜查，可見他穿着露趾鞋。（陳佩瑩攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138440631245475840057198.jpeg/GVpzFSpjbouPqxZfz32CzD2K_P8_fElqGnPZJRpz2SU\"/><figcaption>警方押解疑犯在場搜查，可見他穿着露趾鞋。（陳佩瑩攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"緝毒犬在場搜索。（陳佩瑩攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138442990222577664028614.jpeg/mIGYUrwCbRarRbEsceTrja6QTYWFDzqw2vNSO9rzUjs\"/><figcaption>緝毒犬在場搜索。（陳佩瑩攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"司機被黑布蒙頭。（陳佩瑩攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138442994152771584543720.jpeg/r_8LAmOhl6VsqGWUTdzxPbyjqh4FYIa6jxMU1o8TFNY\"/><figcaption>司機被黑布蒙頭。（陳佩瑩攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"據了解，涉事司機年約70歲。（黃煦緻攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138438684400553984392071.jpeg/kl6ZeBhN0O-j6-M2RToD45qWfAdstInqSBk1qW0ZNak\"/><figcaption>據了解，涉事司機年約70歲。（黃煦緻攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方召來緝毒犬，以黑布蒙頭押解涉事司機在場搜證。（黃煦緻攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138438681292443648098563.jpeg/OSDCPZyCSSBkeTLQaEj97O2TPeife4wbb9BOMUrQTjE\"/><figcaption>警方召來緝毒犬，以黑布蒙頭押解涉事司機在場搜證。（黃煦緻攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涉事的士停在東頭村道。（黃煦緻攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138437670859444224097452.jpeg/-VkJa9sx2nEqmxwIDyq_J-fz3cOQwpHadrmg-FO5oPg\"/><figcaption>涉事的士停在東頭村道。（黃煦緻攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方在場調查。（黃煦緻攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138437180012630016468235.jpeg/Yz0E82nYJDe517zq3CVXiYKt8Nw372jkVYmMHnCJjB4\"/><figcaption>警方在場調查。（黃煦緻攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"緝毒犬在場搜索。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138443675051757568913642.jpeg/V0Kkzj0BmRRzd3X5DZI2L18tY64oVj18R6WWBUellgU\"/><figcaption>緝毒犬在場搜索。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"疑犯在場助查。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138443677887238144652793.jpeg/ryuMoE0qlzB_jKULjPkJ97l4fRiYBVemoFo_MqBaPzI\"/><figcaption>疑犯在場助查。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"疑犯在場助查。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138443680521392128950247.jpeg/3nLxXGcXm3cMoFT9c7wYkq89D491AY7lxSmcecUpnHk\"/><figcaption>疑犯在場助查。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-02T03:58:42.144856+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":357,"images":10,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}